<div id="wd-ce26c766" class="wp-block-wd-icon"><img class="wp-image-865" src="http://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/furniture2-gutenberg/wp-content/uploads/sites/28/2024/08/wd-furniture-long-arrow-white.svg" /></div>
