<!-- wp:wd/container {"blockId":"9f8d0179-7aaf-4384-abe3-1070b1727425","textAlign":"center","colGap":"","rowGap":"10","marginBottom":"100","marginBottomTablet":"80","marginBottomMobile":"60"} -->
<div id="wd-9f8d0179" class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col wd-align"><!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"6593a82c-d251-4353-ad92-e8078611f44c","content":"If you can't decide on the perfect gift, let them choose with the WoodMart Gift Card.​"} -->
<h2 id="wd-6593a82c" class="wp-block-wd-title title">If you can't decide on the perfect gift, let them choose with the WoodMart Gift Card.​</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"15fbd790-5e6b-4ef5-b7f6-5d428888cb53","displayWidth":"custom","customWidth":"940"} -->
<p id="wd-15fbd790" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-custom-width">The WoodMart Gift Card is easy! Just pick the value of the card and your friends or family are free to get exactly what they want! It's perfect for graduations, holidays, back to college shopping, baby showers, weddings and house warming gifts. Available in increments of €5 - €1 000.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/container -->

<!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"f30f982f-a96c-4c40-a3ee-98f289121247","content":"Frequently asked questions​","tpFontSize":"32","tpFontSizeTablet":"26","tpFontSizeMobile":"22"} -->
<h2 id="wd-f30f982f" class="wp-block-wd-title title">Frequently asked questions​</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion {"blockId":"4397f9ee-9601-4ffc-bc46-3e0e0da1f2bb","allClosed":true,"titleTpFontFamily":"var(\u002d\u002dwd-title-font)","titleTpFontSize":"18","titleTpFontVariant":"600","titleTpFontWeight":"600","titleTpFontSizeMobile":"16"} -->
<div id="wd-4397f9ee" class="wp-block-wd-accordion wd-accordion wd-style-default wd-titles-start wd-opener-style-arrow wd-opener-pos-end" data-state="all"><!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"1b96e9e9-efc7-4692-b074-6419c5117692"} -->
<div id="wd-1b96e9e9" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What is the difference between an e-Gift Card and physical Gift Card?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"75ecb72f-9cf1-4c9b-9fa7-55d96e22bf7f"} -->
<p id="wd-75ecb72f" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">A seemingly elegant design can quickly begin to bloat with unexpected content or break under the weight of actual activity. Fake data can ensure a nice looking layout but it doesn’t reflect what a living, breathing application must endure. Real data does.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"a6979897-e64b-44c0-988d-8d0102f01efd"} -->
<div id="wd-a6979897" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Do I have to use my Gift Card all at once?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"b174e10c-b95d-4a3b-993e-cc5ad28b5d19"} -->
<p id="wd-b174e10c" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">Websites in professional use templating systems. Commercial publishing platforms and content management systems ensure that you can show different text, different data using the same template. When it's about controlling hundreds of articles, product pages for web shops.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"b3e3e6b6-2195-49ff-a0ca-c4aef067d076"} -->
<div id="wd-b3e3e6b6" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>When will I receive my e-Gift Card?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"da1e1060-6abd-4a74-8c41-05d1b207ee6d"} -->
<p id="wd-da1e1060" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">If the copy becomes distracting in the design then you are doing something wrong or they are discussing copy changes. It might be a bit annoying but you could tell them that that discussion would be best suited for another time. At worst the discussion is at least working towards the final goal of your site where questions about lorem ipsum don’t.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"4cc2d08a-deba-48a1-bb7e-635f22b5b086"} -->
<div id="wd-4cc2d08a" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Can I also find these gift cards at retailers?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"e801d816-a3b0-437f-97e9-106a5745305c"} -->
<p id="wd-e801d816" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">A seemingly elegant design can quickly begin to bloat with unexpected content or break under the weight of actual activity. Fake data can ensure a nice looking layout but it doesn’t reflect what a living, breathing application must endure. Real data does.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"38aeb1ca-afb3-43a3-a9c8-0dbaae69b992"} -->
<div id="wd-38aeb1ca" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>How many gift cards can I purchase at once?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"18c50c03-5c17-4557-8959-48ead5a7a2c6"} -->
<p id="wd-18c50c03" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">Websites in professional use templating systems. Commercial publishing platforms and content management systems ensure that you can show different text, different data using the same template. When it's about controlling hundreds of articles, product pages for web shops.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"dfec1f61-781e-4656-80c4-c7dbdb87df6e","textAlign":"center","marginBottom":"30","marginBottomMobile":"0"} -->
<p id="wd-dfec1f61" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-align">If you want more information about Gift Cards <a href="https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/furniture2-gutenberg/contact-us/" data-type="page" data-id="173">Contact us</a></p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
